  "description": "Telekinesis by mass class (#10164): every skill, god, notarget, the level's NPCs removed. Before each grab two belt slots are drunk (twelve mana potions, 50 each, given in the setup: mana is the build's 100) and telekinesis deployed again (Deploy_Spell_AIR_1; drinking puts the sword back in hand). Each grab holds console +attack 2.5 s, turns the view (10 degrees up, or at the orc), lets attack go (the object stays where it is held, in stasis) and presses it again: the throw (attack2 is the game's parry, and puts the spell away). l01_a's props where they stand: the jug (4 kg) and bread (1) on the upper hall's table, the table (40), a wood bin (30); the lower room's broom (5), two barrels (80) and a stool (40); the crate room's small crate (40) and two big crates (300, past Big_Object_Mass 120). Then an orc, spawned where the view meets the upper hall's floor, takes two stools, a table and a log thrown at it, and is grabbed and thrown itself. Each test is marked in the console with echo rb_tk. Masses are each model's .phy.",
